fix: keep teacher pages steady on delete/remove (no skeleton flash)

- load()/refreshSubmissions() accept { silent: true } so background refreshes
  and visibility-change refetches don't blank the list
- Optimistic UI: delete/remove prune subRows + students locally first, then
  silently re-sync with Supabase
- Sync buttons get their own syncing state so the spinner is on the button
